alue":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"interface-table-rowsorting-tfeatures-tdata","text":"Interface: Table_RowSorting<_TFeatures, _TData>","level":1},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tfeatures","text":"_TFeatures","level":3},{"id":"tdata","text":"_TData","level":3},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"resetsorting","text":"resetSorting()","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"defaultstate","text":"defaultState?","level":5},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"setsorting","text":"setSorting()","level":3},{"id":"parameters-2","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"updater","text":"updater","level":5},{"id":"returns-2","text":"Returns","level":4}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Interface: Table\\_RowSorting\\<_TFeatures, _TData\\>\n\nDefined in: [features/row-sorting/rowSortingFeature.types.ts:266](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/row-sorting/rowSortingFeature.types.ts#L266)\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### _TFeatures\n\n`_TFeatures` *extends* [`TableFeatures`](TableFeatures.md)\n\n### _TData\n\n`_TData` *extends* [`RowData`](../type-aliases/RowData.md)\n\n## Properties\n\n### resetSorting()\n\n```ts\nresetSorting: (defaultState?) => void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/row-sorting/rowSortingFeature.types.ts:275](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/row-sorting/rowSortingFeature.types.ts#L275)\n\nResets `sorting` to `initialState.sorting`.\n\nPass `true` to ignore initial state and reset to `[]`.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### defaultState?\n\n`boolean`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n***\n\n### setSorting()\n\n```ts\nsetSorting: (updater) => void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/row-sorting/rowSortingFeature.types.ts:279](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/row-sorting/rowSortingFeature.types.ts#L279)\n\nUpdates sorting state with a next ordered array or updater function.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### updater\n\n[`Updater`](../type-aliases/Updater.md)\\<[`SortingState`](../type-aliases/SortingState.md)\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: Table_RowSorting\ntitle: Table_RowSorting\n---\n\n# Interface: Table\\_RowSorting\\<_TFeatures, _TData\\>\n\nDefined in: [features/row-sorting/rowSortingFeature.types.ts:266](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/row-sorting/rowSortingFeature.types.ts#L266)\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### _TFeatures\n\n`_TFeatures` *extends* [`TableFeatures`](TableFeatures.md)\n\n### _TData\n\n`_TData` *extends* [`RowData`](../type-aliases/RowData.md)\n\n## Properties\n\n### resetSorting()\n\n```ts\nresetSorting: (defaultState?) => void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/row-sorting/rowSortingFeature.types.ts:275](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/row-sorting/rowSortingFeature.types.ts#L275)\n\nResets `sorting` to `initialState.sorting`.\n\nPass `true` to ignore initial state and reset to `[]`.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### defaultState?\n\n`boolean`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n***\n\n### setSorting()\n\n```ts\nsetSorting: (updater) => void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/row-sorting/rowSortingFeature.types.ts:279](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/row-sorting/rowSortingFeature.types.ts#L279)\n\nUpdates sorting state with a next ordered array or updater function.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### updater\n\n[`Updater`](../type-aliases/Updater.md)\\<[`SortingState`](../type-aliases/SortingState.md)\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n"}
